--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ported work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The rule logic in this repository is a reimplementation of the rule core of
ChelseaKR/ctdl-validate (https://github.com/ChelseaKR/ctdl-validate), which
is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 and is by the same author.
Rule citation text is carried over from that repository unchanged, because it
quotes Credential Engine's published documentation.

Eleven of the JSON fixtures under parity/ are vendored from that repository's
test suite unmodified; the provenance of every fixture is recorded in
parity/PROVENANCE.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored specification files
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/main/resources/vendor/ contains unmodified copies of Credential Engine's
published CTDL and CTDL-ASN schema encodings and JSON-LD context documents:

    vendor/ctdl/schema.json       https://credreg.net/ctdl/schema/encoding/json
    vendor/ctdl/context.json      https://credreg.net/ctdl/schema/context/json
    vendor/ctdlasn/schema.json    https://credreg.net/ctdlasn/schema/encoding/json
    vendor/ctdlasn/context.json   https://credreg.net/ctdlasn/schema/context/json

CTDL and CTDL-ASN are Credential Engine's, published under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Source URLs, retrieval dates,
and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in src/main/resources/vendor/SOURCES.md.

